       ],
       "__autoSerializationID": "ValueSelectField"
      },
      "isRequired": true,
      "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About Interview Recording</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">To keep your interview experience seamless and distraction-free, we use an AI Notetaker to record and transcribe our interviews. This helps interviewers focus fully on the conversation and ensures your responses are captured accurately. The recording will only be used internally for evaluation. If you would prefer not to be recorded, you can opt out on this page. Opting out will not impact your candidacy in any way.</p>"
